OL,4,CMan appears in court over double fatal 
OL,5,Ccrash                                  
OL,6,GA man has appeared in court over the   
OL,7,Gdeaths of two women in a crash that    
OL,8,Galso left a nine-year-old boy with     
OL,9,Glife-changing injuries.                
OL,11,FAmie Pearson, 26, and Chelsea          
OL,12,FCarlisle, 29, were travelling in a     
OL,13,FSuzuki Alto with the boy, now 10, when 
OL,14,Fthe car was involved in a crash with a 
OL,15,FVauxhall Meriva in Pleasley, on the    
OL,16,FDerbyshire-Nottinghamshire border, at  
OL,17,Fabout 06:20 GMT on 27 November 2025.   
OL,19,FA passenger in the Vauxhall also       
OL,20,Fsuffered serious injuries, police said.
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
