OL,4,CMan trapped under Christmas wheel ride 
OL,5,Cin hospital                            
OL,6,GA man was taken to hospital after      
OL,7,Gbecoming trapped under a big wheel     
OL,8,Gride that was due to feature as part   
OL,9,Gof a Christmas event in Leicestershire.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service 
OL,12,Fsaid it was called to Market Square in 
OL,13,FLoughborough at 09:40 GMT on Wednesday 
OL,14,Fto reports that "a person was trapped  
OL,15,Fbeneath fairground equipment".         
OL,17,FCharnwood Borough Council confirmed    
OL,18,Fthe incident involved a big wheel      
OL,19,Fride, which was due to feature as part 
OL,20,Fof a privately operated Christmas      
OL,21,Fevent.                                 
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
