OL,4,CMother excited for son's first         
OL,5,CChristmas at home                      
OL,6,G"It's been weird getting used to not   
OL,7,Ghaving people around us constantly,"   
OL,8,Gsays Becca Smith.                      
OL,10,FHer son Arlo has a rare genetic        
OL,11,Fneurological condition called          
OL,12,Fhyperekplexia, a disease that means he 
OL,13,Fhe has muscle stiffness and sometimes  
OL,14,Fcannot breathe.                        
OL,16,FIn two-and-a-half years, he and his    
OL,17,Fmum have spent just six weeks at home, 
OL,18,Fwith specialist treatment required to  
OL,19,Fhelp him deal with the condition.      
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
