OL,4,CInjured deer dies after dog attack by  
OL,5,Clake                                   
OL,6,GAn injured deer has been put down      
OL,7,Gafter it was attacked by a dog near a  
OL,8,Glake in Leicestershire.                
OL,10,FLinjoy Wildlife Sanctuary in Etwall,   
OL,11,FDerbyshire, said it was called by a    
OL,12,Fmember of the public at about 08:30    
OL,13,FGMT on Wednesday after the deer had    
OL,14,Fbeen attacked at Albert Village Lake.  
OL,16,FThe sanctuary said the deer had an     
OL,17,Folder, healed fracture to its left     
OL,18,Fleg, which would have made it slower   
OL,19,Fto get away, and its other leg and     
OL,20,Fgroin had "multiple bite marks", which 
OL,21,Fleft the muscle torn.                  
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
